# NOTE: assets-src/ is intentionally committed. It holds the 2048² master
# renders that scripts/cutout-space.mjs consumes. They are not deployed —
# only the cut-out WebP results in public/images/space/ ship.
#
# Video masters are the exception: a 1080p generation runs to tens of MB and
# every replacement would stay in git history for good. The encoded cuts in
# public/videos/ are what ships, and they are committed; the master stays in
# the Magnific library it was generated in (see assets-src/video/PROMPTS.md).
/assets-src/video/*.mp4
/assets-src/video/*.mov
